    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSB201 · Chapter 2 · Session 5</span>\n<h2>Session 5 — Chapter 1. Effective bussiness Communication</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 11499 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSB201 · Chương 2 · Buổi 5</span>\n<h2>Buổi 5 — Chapter 1. Effective bussiness Communication</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 11499 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 1. Effective bussiness Communication<br><br>Why Is It Important to Communicate Well?<br><br>What Is Communication?</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>- Read Chapter 1, Business communication for success<br><br>- Read slides: Chapter 1</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Reading<br><br>Review Chapter 1</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CT2.2</strong> — Are you an introvert or an extrovert? In your opinion, how important is communication in daily life in general and in business in particular?</li>\n<li><strong>CT2.3</strong> — What is business communication &amp; why do you need it?</li>\n<li><strong>HN2.2</strong> — Describe a communication process that you observed when you communicate with friends/family members/co-workers/…</li>\n<li><strong>HN2.3</strong> — How is business communication different from day-to-day communication? How important is Business communication to business activities?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
